                "text": "Kicking off Day 1 of our 15th annual farm tour at Crabapple Farm in Chesterfield!\n\nSales from nutrition assistance programs like HIP and SNAP make small local farms like these viable\u2014benefits that are essential to not just those in need, but to the entire community.\n\nCheck out Tevis and Rachel\u2019s fresh produce at the Northampton farmers market on Tuesdays!",
