                "text": "I heard all day from local farmers about the challenges and uncertainties they\u2019re facing. For young family farms like Bardwell Farm, the loss of business because of Trump\u2019s cruel cuts to nutrition programs has been particularly difficult.\n\nTo ensure America\u2019s food security for generations to come, we must step up our investment in young farmers. Harrison and the folks at Bardwell sell fantastic fresh produce\u2014I hope you\u2019ll join me in supporting our next generation of farmers!",
