                "text": "Incredibly important conversation about food, hunger and nutrition w/ Chef Johanna Hellrigl Wilder\u2014thanks to @foodtank @GW_GlobalFood @mgodoyh \n\nAs I said on stage\u2014hunger is a political condition. We can\u2019t make America healthy again if people can\u2019t access or afford healthy food. https://t.co/mpqOglpOMS",
